  2026-11-11 - Extensible local voice profiles qualified.
    Action: added named installed-voice profiles, gender/culture selection,
      pitch/rate/volume, unsaved preview, save/use/rename/duplicate and deletion.
    Mechanism: bounded serialized atomic storage, lazy catalog, strict provider
      validation and cancellable per-utterance snapshots. All desktop speech
      paths share the host provider entry; capture first stops owned preview.
      Invalid previews preserve current playback; superseded queued speech
      rejects cancellation rather than falsely reporting playback completion.
    Decision: installed local voices for this prototype; arbitrary identity,
      timbre and emotional style are mandatory future-engine work. The seam
      does not implement that engine or authorize downloads/cloud processing.
    Evidence: lint/type/build, eight Vitest, 14 voice/native, 17 mesh/work host
      and all 17 packaged desktop cases pass. Native PCM checks verify pitch,
      rate, silence and exact installed selection without audible playback.
      Portable startup loaded 40 contexts/30 links, discovered installed voices
